OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and wet start to the
OL,6,Fday with rain heavy in places,
OL,7,Fespecially over higher ground. Rain
OL,8,Feases a little into the afternoon, but
OL,9,Fit will remain cloudy with further
OL,10,Foutbreaks of rain at times.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying cloudy across the
OL,13,Fregion overnight as showers shift
OL,14,Fnorthwards through the early hours.
OL,15,FHill fog is likely on higher ground,
OL,16,Fthough it will remain mild for many.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
