OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FCloud will slowly break up
OL,6,Fduring the morning, allowing some
OL,7,Fbrighter spells to develop. Cloud and
OL,8,Frain however will return from the west
OL,9,Flater. Feeling warm, especially in any
OL,10,Fbrightness.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FChangeable conditions continue, with
OL,14,Ffurther spells of rain. Saturday
OL,15,Flikely to be drier and brighter,
OL,16,Fbefore potentially some wet and windy
OL,17,Fweather moves in on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
